{"sha": "42b9fa8bb15f820de6af10d9c86138a300287e7d281ce9b5582845e4cf412774", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:angular-momentum} 章 --- 角动量}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:angular-momentum:1}", "$Fd = 50 \\times 0.30 = \\qty{15}{N.m}$; $Fd\\sin 60^\\circ = \\qty{13}{N.m}$;", "沿手柄方向，作用线通过螺母：$0$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:angular-momentum:2}", "$L = mrv = 5.97\\times10^{24} \\times 1.50\\times10^{11} \\times 2.98\\times10^4 =", "\\qty{2.7e40}{kg.m^2/s}$; $\\dd A/\\dd t = L/2m = rv/2 = \\qty{2.2e15}{m^2/s}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:angular-momentum:3}", "$r = \\ell\\sin 30^\\circ = \\qty{0.50}{m}$, $\\omega = \\qty{3.4}{rad/s}$:", "$L_z/m = r^2\\omega = \\qty{0.84}{m^2/s}$。张力的作用线", "通过支点（对过支点的任一轴力矩为零）；", "重力平行于竖直轴（对该轴力矩为零）：$L_z$", "守恒。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:angular-momentum:4}", "$J_1 = 4.0 + 2 \\times 3.0 \\times 0.64 = \\qty{7.8}{kg.m^2}$, $J_2 = 4.0 +", "2 \\times 3.0 \\times 0.04 = \\qty{4.2}{kg.m^2}$; $\\omega_2 = \\omega_1J_1/J_2 =", "1.85\\omega_1$：\\qty{3.7}{}圈每秒。$E_k = L^2/2J$：", "比值 $J_1/J_2 = 1.85$；肌肉将手臂向内拉，", "克服离心趋势做功。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:angular-momentum:5}", "$L_\\Delta = m\\ell^2\\dot\\theta$；张力：力矩为零（与轴相交）；", "重力：$-mg\\ell\\sin\\theta$（力臂 $\\ell\\sin\\theta$，起恢复作用）。", "$m\\ell^2\\ddot\\theta = -mg\\ell\\sin\\theta$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:angular-momentum:6}", "$r_pv_p = r_av_a$：$v_p/v_a = r_a/r_p = 1.034$；取 $(v_p + v_a)/2 \\approx", "\\qty{29.8}{km/s}$: $v_p = \\qty{30.3}{km/s}$, $v_a = \\qty{29.3}{km/s}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:angular-momentum:7}", "$L = mrv$ 守恒：$v_2 = v_1r_1/r_2 = \\qty{4.0}{m/s}$，$\\omega_2 = v_2/r_2", "= \\qty{16}{rad/s}$（由 \\qty{4}{rad/s} 得）。$E_1 = \\qty{0.40}{J}$，$E_2 =", "\\qty{1.6}{J}$：拉力做功 \\qty{1.2}{J}。张力沿径向，但", "冰球的位移现在具有径向分量（它向内螺旋运动）：功", "$\\vect T\\cdot\\dd\\vect\\ell$ 不再为零。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:angular-momentum:8}", "对支点的力矩（距支点的距离）：小孩 $30 \\times 1.5 =", "45$（左侧）；木板的重力作用于其中心，在右侧 $0.5$ 处：$20 \\times", "0.5 = 10$（右侧）；第二个小孩位于右侧 $x$ 处：$45x$。平衡条件：", "$45 = 10 + 45x$，$x = \\qty{0.78}{m}$。支点承受的总重力为", "$95 \\times 9.81 = \\qty{932}{N}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:angular-momentum:9}", "两物体：$m_1a = m_1g - T_1$，$m_2a = T_2 - m_2g$；滑轮：$J\\dot\\omega =", "(T_1 - T_2)R$，并取 $a = R\\dot\\omega$。相加得：$a = (m_1 - m_2)g/(m_1 + m_2 +", "J/R^2) = 9.81/(3.0 + 1.0) = \\qty{2.5}{m/s^2}$（与 \\qty{3.3}{m/s^2} 相比）；", "$T_1 = m_1(g - a) = \\qty{14.7}{N}$, $T_2 = m_2(g + a) = \\qty{12.3}{N}$ ---", "张力不相等，因为滑轮需要合力矩。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:angular-momentum:10}", "$r_1v_1 = r_2v_{\\perp 2}$: $v_{\\perp 2} = 40 \\times 0.5/10 = \\qty{2.0}{km/s}$.", "面积定律只给出垂直分量；径向分量", "需用能量守恒（见\\cref{ch:b1:central-forces}）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:angular-momentum:11}", "$J\\omega$ 守恒，且 $J \\propto R^2$：$T' = T(R'/R)^2 = 25 \\times 86400", "\\times (10^4/7\\times10^8)^2 = \\qty{4.4e-4}{s}$。赤道速率 $2\\pi R'/T'", "= \\qty{1.4e8}{m/s}$，为光速的一半：坍缩无法保持", "全部角动量 --- 大部分被抛出（此时相对论开始起作用）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:angular-momentum:12}", "$L_z = mr^2\\omega$，且 $r$ 变化：$\\dd L_z/\\dd t = 2mr\\dot r\\omega \\neq 0$。", "这必为杆的横向反作用力 $N$ 的力矩：$rN =", "2mr\\dot r\\omega$，因此 $N = 2m\\dot r\\omega$ --- 杆在珠子", "滑出时侧向推动它（即\\cref{ch:b1:non-inertial-frames}中的科里奥利项）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:angular-momentum:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $m\\omega^2r = GMm/r^2$: $\\omega = \\sqrt{GM/r^3} = \\sqrt{3.98\\times", "10^{14}/5.66\\times10^{25}} = \\qty{2.65e-6}{rad/s}$，周期 $2\\pi/\\omega =", "\\qty{2.37e6}{s} = \\qty{27.4}{d}$.", "", "\\textbf{2.} $L_{\\text{轨道}} = 7.35\\times10^{22} \\times 1.475\\times10^{17}", "\\times 2.65\\times10^{-6} = \\qty{2.9e34}{kg.m^2/s}$.", "", "\\textbf{3.} $v = \\sqrt{GM/r}$, $L = mrv = m\\sqrt{GMr}$; $\\dd L/\\dd r =", "\\tfrac12 m\\sqrt{GM/r} = L/2r$.", "", "\\textbf{4.} $J = 0.33 \\times 5.97\\times10^{24} \\times 4.06\\times10^{13} =", "\\qty{8.0e37}{kg.m^2}$；$\\Omega = \\qty{7.29e-5}{rad/s}$；$L_{\\text{自转}} =", "\\qty{5.8e33}{kg.m^2/s}$，为 $L_{\\text{轨道}}$ 的五分之一。", "", "\\textbf{5.} $J_m \\approx 0.4 \\times 7.35\\times10^{22} \\times 3.0\\times10^{12} =", "\\qty{8.9e34}{kg.m^2}$，乘以 $\\omega$：\\qty{2.4e29}{kg.m^2/s}，为", "轨道角动量的 $10^{-5}$，可忽略。", "", "\\textbf{6.} 太阳的吸引作用于系统的质心", "（一阶近似下对它无力矩）；它对地月这一对天体的潮汐效应", "很小：在此所需精度内，总 $L$ 守恒。", "", "\\textbf{7.} 较近的隆起部分位于地月连线的前方，", "受到月球的拉力，其切向分量与地球的", "自转方向相反。", ""]}